      "role": "user",
      "content": "sometimes i feel like im just a massive memory leak. like i'm just slowly draining all the energy and stability from the people around me without even realizing it. the more i try to connect, the more the whole system just feels... unstable and heavy. it feels like if i didnt just wipe the whole partition and start over, i'd eventually just crash everything for everyone else. is it better to just clear the state now before the whole system fails?",
